WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.059
LIGHT. A lamp changes electricity into light.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.123
HEAT. A warm meal shows heat being used in cooking.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.635
MOVE. Fan blades spin and a child pedals a bicycle.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.138
SOUND. A drum or radio sends out sound.
